# THE SERVER FOLDER, and without this line nothing works.
#
# An embeddable Python takes its ENTIRE sys.path from this file and does NOT
# add the running script's own directory the way a normal install does. So
# `python.exe server\fut_rs4_stub.py` starts, fails on `import futpack`, and
# the message names a module that is sitting right beside the script.
..\server

